window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Amelia’s life was saved, but at what cost? Turned a vampire by an immortal child, her newfound life may be in danger and out of her control.</p> <p></p> <p>At the same time, a human cult has made it their mission to rid New Orleans of the monstrous atrocities of vampires and werewolves by any means possible. Drawing their recruits from a local university, Amelia goes undercover to infiltrate the group. While there, she discovers there’s more to the evil group than meets the eye and encounters someone no one expected.</p> <p></p> <p>Amelia, Celeste, and Viktor are forced to make decisions that could change the course of their lives forever as they battle an unseen opponent, not to mention their own egos.</p>"; 
